From 694e63a67728122090cf0a23150963c20316e8e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:37:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dicts: mint RABT_00-RABT_40 for the About page

41 keys, English-seeded in all 25 packs in lockstep (6586 -> 6627). The closed
resolver has no EN fallback, which is why every pack must carry every key - the
non-English packs render the English text until translated, exactly as the RFW_*
namespace does. Translation is owed and tracked in the backlog.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
